{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c0c6d5ee40a03e32fbd5f5ba65d05a89e5fd3d11dccfd471bba7f7a332c19ab1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa766a44c38990b4169ea61e34d6a7860948260f86eff2225b920d6c3bdd9fb5",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fd4d316088071cc8f09ca985e2b2c28624c9462b2d05174eed4b471eb4969cd",
      "text": "方便哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d70ec5a57573762883bc32dd53c992c604d7529cd70b55ac8c2df58e5a35b504",
      "text": "谢谢。今天练习的时候，我们互换了在CM里\n饰演的王子角色试了试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822c5ac106192f15488294070eaf43eca5fc27e68aa4e7ddfb16f630cb7d616c",
      "text": "有点小坏心眼的皮埃尔和病娇的恭二，\n都超级棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f0bcb799ad3b493b198035e5141a6a07e1da640e8f0562b73b527e8701c964c",
      "text": "真想让●●●●プロデューサー也\n看一看啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a61cc20062e7129b17e4ba7fd0987083a4cf6075f5f4863c7801d7c99e341e",
      "text": "顺便说一下，我演了恭二饰演的\n霸道王子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:300f22f046b222b1c5f589e6a1e550d3018a643f05382eb15e737d1135f8278a",
      "text": "“这饮料，你之前说过喜欢的吧？\n……笨蛋，我怎么可能会忘。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f37e7d1cd92b072d41cbbe3fcd47a8b40d5242c86aba75a1bcc06ba6da789b57",
      "text": "“能让我做到这种地步的女人只有你一个。\n你该觉得光荣吧？”像这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:913bd8cc74a2cdd64b3784cc4b1f7e03d6a99ec9f4a7c4161426be23f750180a",
      "text": "霸道的实先生，\n很新鲜呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:865b4070f204476491c1a0c0953f04fed945b6399df92ba1406e005d6d9a1926",
      "text": "啊哈哈，确实可能挺新鲜的。\n什么时候我也想演一次霸道的角色呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_306_2_3_011_06_09_a:2_3_011_06_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38d39eaa040fe8db358d8bdc25ca8ab3dc2f67f78b6cefd7241ae22789cf3434",
      "text": "啊，聊了这么久不好意思。能和●●●●プロデューサー\n聊天很开心哦。那么，再见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
